# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local environment (MUST live under .env/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Convention: all secrets live under .env/ (directory).
# Un-ignore the dir, ignore its contents, keep the tracked README.
.env/
!.env/
.env/**
!.env/README.md

# Legacy / accidental secret filenames outside .env/ (defense in depth)
# Root-level .env *file* only (directory handled above)
/.env
.env.*
!.env/
!.env.example
!.env/README.md
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
**/secrets/

